# "Exiled card with flashback": a card exiled face down has no characteristics (CR 406.3a), so it has no flashback. On
# turn 1 Bot1's Flameshape exiles its own Firebolt and an Island face down, and its Lightning Bolt goes to the graveyard.
# On turn 3 Schemes cannot target the face-down Firebolt, and returns the Bolt.
# Sorceress's Schemes {3}{R}: Sorcery
#   Return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard or exiled card with flashback you own to your hand. Add {R}.
#   Flashback {4}{R}

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Gandalf, Goblins' Bane
Lightning Bolt
Sorceress's Schemes
Firebolt
Island
Mountain
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

